    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Highland Ritual is a PSX Style First-Person horror game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before his death, your grandpa mentioned about a ritual hunt your family has been part of for generations, however, your grandpa never finished what he started and he always regretted it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left with his journal and a map, you go to finish what he started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the hunt however, you soon find out that nothing is what it seems and you are soon enough caught up in something more dark and sinister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hunter becomes the hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PSX Style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Horror Game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt stags and complete the ritual</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide and run from the cultist chasing you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror game based on the Scottish myth of the White Stag</p></li></ul>",
